# Copy to .env and fill in.

# ── Yahoo Fantasy API (official, via YFPY) ────────────────────────────────
# Create an app at https://developer.yahoo.com/apps/create/
#   Application Type : Installed Application
#   Redirect URI     : https://localhost:8080
#   API Permissions  : Fantasy Sports (Read)
# Then run:  uv run python pull_league.py   (first run does a one-time browser OAuth)
YAHOO_CONSUMER_KEY=
YAHOO_CONSUMER_SECRET=
# (pull_league.py caches the OAuth token back into this file after the first run)

# ── Emailed Tuesday digest (optional) ────────────────────────────────────
# Gmail: SMTP_PASS must be a 16-char App Password (Google account > Security >
# App passwords), not your normal password. Requires 2-Step Verification.
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=
DIGEST_TO=you@gmail.com

# ── Vegas player props (optional, §20) ───────────────────────────────────
# Free key (500 credits/month) from https://the-odds-api.com — no card needed.
# Props ARE included on the free plan. The cost model is what matters:
#   the event list is free; props are [markets] x [regions] per event, so one
#   sweep of a full 16-game slate across our 7 markets is 112 credits.
# That is ~4 sweeps a month, so the refresh holds itself to roughly weekly and
# refuses a sweep it cannot finish. The $30 tier (20,000) makes it daily —
# set ODDS_REFRESH_HOURS=24 if you upgrade.
ODDS_API_KEY=
# ODDS_REFRESH_HOURS=150
